<title>USA: TMM to issue up to $200 mln debt in U.S..</title>
<headline>TMM to issue up to $200 mln debt in U.S..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transportacion Maritima Mexicana SA de CV said it intends to issue up to $200 million in debt in the U.S. market.</p>
<p>TMM, headquartered in Mexico City, would offer no further details.</p>
<p>-- U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
</text>
